        <li><span class="step-t">ตรวจคำตอบ</span> \(\vec{v}_1\cdot\vec{v}_2 = 5 - 4 + 0 - 1 = 0\) ✓ — <strong>สรุป:</strong> \(\{(1,-4,0,1), (5,1,0,-1)\}\)</li>
      </ol>
    </div></details>
