  <article class="pr-card" id="p-4-3-4ค" data-pkey="pTB-4-3-4ค">
    <div class="pr-head"><span class="pr-num">แบบฝึกหัด 4.3 ข้อ 4 (ค)</span><span class="tag exam">🎯 แนว ⑥</span><span class="diff">●●●</span><span class="spacer"></span>
